add('Only three for this pot','MAYA, LEO, ELLA','POTTING_BENCH','Close garden seed dish with exactly three small round seeds.','Maya tips exactly three radish seeds into a shallow dedicated garden dish. Leo closes the remaining seed packet and returns it to the dry tray.','Radish packet open; no seed in soil; empty small garden dish on tray.','Three radish seeds in dish; remaining seed stock closed in packet; right pot still unsown.','Stock packet is not additional sown inventory; no seeds eaten or spilled.','ELLA|Three seeds for this pot.','MAYA|The rest stay dry in their packet.','LEO|A tiny beginning does not need a crowded home.')
