add('Day one means day one','LEO, NINA, DAN','POTTING_BENCH','Close dry notebook page; garden behind remains same morning.','Leo starts the journal with Day 1: planted, two seedlings upright, radish soil bare. Nina checks the honest wording; Dan adds a small outline of three pots.','All three pots planted and labeled; water can still 500 mL; no watering record yet.','Day 1 planting record written; two leafy seedlings observed, no radish shoots reported.','No invented growth measurement or later-day entry; readable journal text comes from GROWTH_JOURNAL.svg.','LEO|Day one: planted. No radish shoots yet.','DAN|An honest report from a quiet pot.','NINA|That is how a useful journal begins.')
